Revision history for Coin::Hnoss

0.006_02 2026-11-09
       - Fix allocate: allocate on |amount| then negate, so that
         allocate(-x, ...) is the element-wise negation of
         allocate(x, ...). Previous version put the rounding unit in
         the opposite direction for negative amounts.

0.006  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->allocate for splitting money across
         ratios without losing minor units.

0.005  2026-11-09
       - Add comparison and predicates to Coin::Hnoss::Money.
       - Overload <=>, ==, !=, <, >, <=, >= to use compare.

0.004_01 2026-11-09
       - Document floor semantics for divide / divide_with_remainder.

0.004  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Exception base class.
       - Add arithmetic to Coin::Hnoss::Money.

0.003  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money (immutable amount + currency value object).

0.002  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency (ISO 4217 code value object).

0.001  2026-11-09
       - Initial skeleton.
